# Booking — Schedule Availability endpoint
# UC-011 (guest views calendar availability)
# TenantContext populated from X-Tenant-ID header (public endpoint — no actor headers needed).
#
# Prerequisites:
#   1. pnpm infra:up
#   2. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run migration:run
#   3. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run dev
#
# REST Client environment: select "local" in VS Code status bar

@baseUrl = {{backendUrl}}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HAPPY PATH — open day, one service, no closures
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/availability?date=2026-06-01&serviceIds={{serviceId}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HAPPY PATH — multiple services
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/availability?date=2026-06-01&serviceIds={{serviceId}},{{service2Id}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 422 — date in the past
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/availability?date=2020-01-01&serviceIds={{serviceId}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 400 — serviceId not found / wrong tenant
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/availability?date=2026-06-01&serviceIds=00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000099999
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 400 — missing serviceIds param (Zod validation)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/availability?date=2026-06-01
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 400 — malformed date param
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/availability?date=not-a-date&serviceIds={{serviceId}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# M23-S29 — pinned selections and a chosen duration
# resourceSelections = <serviceId>:<legIndex or ->:<resourceType>:<resourceId>[,…]
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Availability with the customer's chosen resource pinned to a CUSTOMER_CHOICE requirement
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/availability?date=2026-06-01&serviceIds={{serviceId}}&resourceSelections={{serviceId}}:-:STAFF:{{resourceId}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

###

### Availability for a legged service — the pick is addressed to its leg
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/availability?date=2026-06-01&serviceIds={{serviceId}}&resourceSelections={{serviceId}}:0:STAFF:{{resourceId}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

###

### Availability for a CUSTOMER_SELECTED service with its chosen duration
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/availability?date=2026-06-01&serviceIds={{serviceId}}&durationMinutes=120
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

###

### Summary with a pinned pick and a chosen duration
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/availability/summary?from=2026-06-01&to=2026-06-07&serviceIds={{serviceId}}&resourceSelections={{serviceId}}:-:STAFF:{{resourceId}}&durationMinutes=120
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

###

### 400 — resourceId and resourceSelections together
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/availability?date=2026-06-01&serviceIds={{serviceId}}&resourceId={{resourceId}}&resourceSelections={{serviceId}}:-:STAFF:{{resourceId}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

###

### 400 — malformed resourceSelections item
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/availability?date=2026-06-01&serviceIds={{serviceId}}&resourceSelections=not-a-selection
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

###

### 422 — a pick that is not a CUSTOMER_CHOICE requirement of the service, or an inactive/out-of-pool/other-tenant resource (BOOKING_SERVICE_RESOURCE_TYPE_UNAVAILABLE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/availability?date=2026-06-01&serviceIds={{serviceId}}&resourceSelections={{serviceId}}:-:ROOM:{{resourceId}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

###

### 422 — durationMinutes out of range for a CUSTOMER_SELECTED service (BOOKING_DURATION_OUT_OF_RANGE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/availability?date=2026-06-01&serviceIds={{serviceId}}&durationMinutes=9999
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

###

### 422 — durationMinutes with more than one CUSTOMER_SELECTED service
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/availability?date=2026-06-01&serviceIds={{serviceId}},{{service2Id}}&durationMinutes=60
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
